# Join the Collective destroys a merged creature (Cubwarden mutated under Ornithopter) and the two Cat tokens its
# mutation made. The merged creature is one creature (CR 730.2), an artifact as it last existed (its top card's
# characteristics, CR 730.2a, 608.2h), though one of the cards it becomes is the nonartifact Cubwarden (CR 730.3c): only
# the two Cats are nonartifact creatures destroyed this way, so two Borg tokens, not three.
